{"tmdb":1794165,"tagline":"","synopsis":"Mariel and Tino, a documentary filmmaking duo specializing in disturbing crimes, investigate a tragedy that occurred a year earlier at a care home, where a young volunteer named Gisela set fire to a dormitory with several children inside. Their investigation leads them to Father Román, a Vatican-sanctioned exorcist who claims to have treated her for demonic possession. Mariel refuses to believe him—until they discover a young woman locked in a forest cabin who claims to be Gisela and accuses the priest of holding her captive.","directors":[{"name":"Andres Beltran","id":1614750}],"cast":[{"actor":"Ruth Ramos","role":"Mariel","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6043w3WOtFSkjw1YGFaP1SItoHr.jpg","tmdb":1731102},{"actor":"Boris Schoemann","role":"Padre Arcadio","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/p6gAXwFUyhXb9M5NrGbGZ2AFH0E.jpg","tmdb":2250841},{"actor":"Laura Padilla","role":"Lucha","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xYsZLHNOfj6toY2X9gYagwSgGjH.jpg","tmdb":2731375},{"actor":"Lisa Siller","role":"Gisela","photo":null,"tmdb":4853198},{"actor":"Jorge Lemus","role":"Ejecutivo","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ds3IJr0ljXP8N4MrhK7b38BnmUZ.jpg","tmdb":4846701},{"actor":"Florinda Bernal","role":"Mamá de Román","photo":null,"tmdb":6616133},{"actor":"David Calderón León","role":"Padre Santiago","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mwAilgEQ8LZjsLau2X7nmL3PmvB.jpg","tmdb":1521266},{"actor":"Josue Guerra","role":"Tino","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uFVEcXRG7YEJMS2fEj5UiYOrqgh.jpg","tmdb":3287144},{"actor":"Julio Maldonado","role":"Harold Perez","photo":null,"tmdb":2539063},{"actor":"Efraín Rosas","role":"Vecino","photo":null,"tmdb":2091182},{"actor":"Aarón Aguilar Luna","role":"Caníbal","photo":null,"tmdb":6616137},{"actor":"Bertha Patricia Sandoval","role":"Vecina","photo":null,"tmdb":6616138}],"trailers":[],"official":null,"watch":{},"artwork":{"posters":[],"backdrops":[],"logos":[]}}